The MyGuichet.lu app enables you to:
•	carry out certain administrative procedures and keep track of their progress directly from your smartphone and/or tablet;
•	add supporting documents to your procedures;
•	consult your communications with administrations; 
•	access certain personal and/or professional data that is held by the Luxembourg authorities.

Luxauto is the number one intermediate for used cars/motorbikes in Luxembourg and the Greater Region (France, Belgium and Germany).
This iPhone app helps you, just as easily as on the site www.luxauto.lu, to find what you are looking for among professional and private ads. 
Features:
- fast and detailed search among over 10.000 ads which have been checked by a car specialist before;
- memorizing of interesting and/or relevant ads;
- saving among preferences/favourites;
- direct mail or phone contact with the seller; 
- look-up of the ads of the day.

GouvID allows you to:
- add your ID card information to an electronic wallet;
- authenticate yourself with an online public service;
- sign documents presented in the context of these services;
- change the initial PIN of your ID card after its issuance;
- change the current PIN of your ID card.

The App Mäin Offall - Meng Ressourcen, developped by the Administration of environment helps you to handle your waste management for several addresses at the same time. 
You can: 
- access the waste calendar of one or more addresses;
- get notifications to remind you of one or more waste collections; 
- access a waste dictionary with information about the waste and how to recover it correctly;
- find and get information about collection points on a map;
- get notifications if waste collection are cancelled or changed.

Sunrise VPN is an application that allows you to securely access the Internet using VPN servers from around the world. Working in the application does not require additional settings, just turn on the VPN with one click.
In the world of information technology, the most reasonable solution for a user who cares about his information security will be to use a VPN server to log on to the Internet. It is now available to connect to the servers of Canada, England and other countries. Using our application "Sunrise VPN – secure and fast VPN", you are guaranteed to be able to ensure your online presence protection, especially when connecting via public Wi-Fi networks.
In the application, we have created a global VPN network, which includes countries such as the USA, England, Canada and other European countries, as well as Asian countries. The list of countries is constantly expanding. Most of the servers are available for free, navigate through the servers in one click.
Advantages of the Sunrise VPN app:
- secure connection (high level of privacy);
- fast Internet (high-speed bandwidth);
- a large number of servers, including : VPN England, VPN Canada, Asian and European countries;
- does not require registration;
- does not require additional settings or permissions;
- small APK size;
- simple and intuitive interface;
- unlimited time to use free servers: VPN Germany, VPN USA, etc.
Install Sunrise VPN - a secure and fast VPN and feel all the benefits of a secure connection without restrictions!

A App NOS é para todos. É para quem quer fazer tudo, sem filas e com facilidade. É para quem quer uma app que evolui a pensar em si.

Faça o download e comece a fazer a gestão da sua conta e serviços NOS no seu telemóvel:
• Consulte faturas, valor em aberto e faça pagamentos;
• Controle os consumos de dados, minutos e sms;
• Veja o saldo e carregue o telemóvel por MB Way;
• Consulte o detalhe das comunicações e faça a gestão de pacotes extra internet;
• Aceda a informação da conta de cliente, detalhe dos serviços contratados e atualize os contactos; 
• Subscreva canais e serviços premium;
• Faça a gestão das configurações do acesso de internet e use o assistente virtual para otimizar o sinal Wi-Fi; 
• Aceda ao Cartão NOS para obter ofertas exclusivas nos Cinemas NOS e noutros eventos;
• Receba ofertas e participe em passatempos exclusivos para clientes NOS.

Após instalar, faça login com o seu NOS ID ou registe-se diretamente na aplicação. Caso já seja utilizador de outras apps ou sites NOS, pode usar os mesmos dados de acesso para fazer login.

O acesso à App NOS não consome dados móveis nem tem custos na rede NOS.
